cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Lorentz Tracer"
abstract: >-
  Interactive charged-particle orbit simulation. Solves the full Lorentz
  force equation in real time across thirteen magnetic field models, with 3D
  visualization, live diagnostics, and guiding-centre trajectory comparison.
  Licensed MIT, except the T89c and T96 field models (src/t89.*, src/t96.*),
  which are ports of IRBEM-LIB code and licensed LGPL-3.0-or-later.
authors:
  - family-names: Burchill
    given-names: Johnathan K.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8364-0307"
version: "0.11.1"
date-released: "2026-10-27"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/JohnathanBurchill/lorentz_tracer"
keywords:
  - plasma physics
  - charged particle
  - Boris integrator
  - guiding centre
  - magnetic field
  - Lorentz force
  - adiabatic invariant
